  "details": "Like the option to hide other peoples avatars i think you should be able to hide or make your avatar revert to a fallback for other users. this could be tied into the safety settings, you could make it so visitors or new users only see your fallback, or only your friends can see your avatar while others would only see your fallback. This has multiple benefits. This would make ripping more difficult to do due to the users needing to load your avatar to their cache to be able to extract it, but if your model is just a fall back they will not have access to it. another reason this would be a good feature is to hide content that might not be suitable for younger audiences, we all know what kinda avatars people use on this game, and since its a 13+ game that means there are minors, so having a suggestive and or violent avatar would not be appropriate for them to see, so if you have a suggestive avatar and you only want your friends to see you this is a good feature. this can prevent younger users from being exposed to more mature content.",
